WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.175
Rounding picks the nearer end.

2
00:00:02.926 --> 00:00:05.601
To three places, nothing changes.

3
00:00:08.503 --> 00:00:11.853
To two places it is past halfway, so it goes up.

4
00:00:14.832 --> 00:00:18.132
To one place the next digit is four, so it stays.
